# Smoke test of the real x4mp.dll against hostsim, no server (ctest hostsim.real_dll).
# Implicit init (no `init` line), 600 frames at 60 Hz (10 s), a reload (shutdown + FreeLibrary + LoadLibrary + init,
# stash kept), more frames, shutdown at the end. Contract: the header comment of mod/native/host/mod_host.h.
expect-file extension/logs/x4mp.log hello
expect-file extension/logs/x4mp.log build check: supported
expect-sub on_frame_update
expect-sub on_game_loaded
expect-sub on_universe_ready
expect-sub on_ui_reload
frame 60Hz 600
load_save slot.xml.gz
ui_reload
reload
expect-state reloads == 1
expect-state subs.on_frame_update == 1
expect-stash host.state present
frame fast 120
expect-no-secret never-written-password
